    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere, Weather sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using (blast type) talents from the air, electrical, or sonic blast type groups, or any blast type deemed appropriate by the GM, when there is an area of rain and wind both at or above category 4, your destructive blast bypasses spell resistance.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/destruction#toc108\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
